{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1449,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c1e1b1ec9b8389dea12b38b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，举起酒杯！\r\n派对就要揭幕了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dd71dc0610424f54843495a9971eb802f4f1cead44c7b2c09c666a309ff1997",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15190ce50b7353a62b08fb81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你陷入沉醉──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b302047c336c5641d836581eafa060d0e5f9ebdedb6767e3db1c6a7dbf90fe3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d03a65817da0a3dbf9a7f8a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是在我的认知中最为极品的酩酊。\r\n没有你就调制不出这杯琴蕾。\r\n你可绝对别忘了这点啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d78cbfdd9f620e85619e5bf7a2de96936e738c79aabe40938a3caa24b3c04cc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe8d6297c703402bd900577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有想过要染成漆黑，\r\n……却遭到了天罚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9780f3e20211cb867781eff1d7de2e51acb19a0c9dc26728181d1aad9c31713a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07bcbc6729e86e2eec40972",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上美丽衣裳的吾──！\r\n这耀眼的光芒简直是罪恶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c0f402041f72897e5e260bfab2b88f018f2682c3dc15cc2f0516967b076be30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:265713f71a3b887aac16c4d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵！看到了吗……！\r\n吾真实的模样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9426db0036d690f48f293ec4501f71948373dde8cc50d2789d6d0a833535e229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab09fc9abab07c7261167cdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……右手在隐隐作痛！\r\n得用宝具封印起来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5a45d4e8c5765a830806febb488845129c2cffaa067a939ced0cc299b9017e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3456ac3799ba2fde6be84681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽的色彩。\r\n简直就是适合飨宴的服装呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb94dc89165e87a17b0c1c87c349723e837562c4c42c959339d30b574da24a76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3928590eae377b77760ad847",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……灵魂蠢蠢欲动！\r\n快让我奔跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b8b910f495189b301eaf348874b974ea044243c24dc755bb540c9fca7b897cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e57b922923cd3535183e09d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要全新的人格吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29e492c48dde9f5e2a1503d2857d4801704e371530f96426bd2e943f901664c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72cdf93b440c1a142573f0ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装需要的就是──\r\n极为美丽的噩梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1224fdd6a02646ba07364ba0f9acd1db50c1815038681c9d2f70673704e0a371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4ec3028199779b3d4584359",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有想过要染成漆黑，\r\n……却遭到了天罚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9780f3e20211cb867781eff1d7de2e51acb19a0c9dc26728181d1aad9c31713a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2da67c720867250ffab2e30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上美丽衣裳的吾──！\r\n这耀眼的光芒简直是罪恶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c0f402041f72897e5e260bfab2b88f018f2682c3dc15cc2f0516967b076be30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f67fcc6430f69070df986e43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵！看到了吗……！\r\n吾真实的模样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9426db0036d690f48f293ec4501f71948373dde8cc50d2789d6d0a833535e229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b23c7d987bc30425aac92b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……右手在隐隐作痛！\r\n得用宝具封印起来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5a45d4e8c5765a830806febb488845129c2cffaa067a939ced0cc299b9017e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db793c0e6cb9c7c68726d9ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽的色彩。\r\n简直就是适合飨宴的服装呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb94dc89165e87a17b0c1c87c349723e837562c4c42c959339d30b574da24a76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b420a79a1510571f67e4905f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……灵魂蠢蠢欲动！\r\n快让我奔跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b8b910f495189b301eaf348874b974ea044243c24dc755bb540c9fca7b897cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aea265d29465dc44f312c2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要全新的人格吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29e492c48dde9f5e2a1503d2857d4801704e371530f96426bd2e943f901664c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1613b98fff4f087276932c98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装需要的就是──\r\n极为美丽的噩梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1224fdd6a02646ba07364ba0f9acd1db50c1815038681c9d2f70673704e0a371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c408e27837461c5e201af10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很厉害嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5397b4fef55f6c897e05a67aabf4682cfbac8f67233993186fd02576fd651f82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0aca857eceb37e6256dd8a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊──哈哈哈！迎接黎明，\r\n新世界揭开序幕了！！踏出步伐，\r\n迈向鲜烈的「此刻」──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4417a10edc1adbb175ac84034ecc1e1cf49d6e334acd54f39cb47acb4620a33c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5c9fb53cbdd4aa143c04f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你今天要如何接纳我。\r\n……说来听听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a2240d83e073e9e7aad7fb24d1a930bb2277909e89b753a661e6192921ed364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb46bfe32eab6d6a2d83cd90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈哈！舒爽的白天！\r\n是最适合彰显破坏的瞬间！\r\n令人愉快的时刻──要开始啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3c771e599119bfcc2d7991764fa5fddb0b89d6027b625e6c085241145df8d48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33498d44333340edc562d6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身上背负的七宗罪。\r\n该精进的自由七艺。\r\n……好了，该从哪里开始享受？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce45ce5b04ae26429a0143a6c19b844d90cc8518004e32eb8cc09f0c9b96356c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d743fbb7266b5c7791e18506",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狼在今日是否就将追赶上月亮，\r\n进而引发诸神黄昏呢……\r\n呵呵，让我好好见证吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f70c72d91e50a586b101c85164eceb4e3b039587deef352d7842cfdad0e30b30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b2cabf033bae772e00526b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息五分钟够吗？总是汲汲营营\r\n会显得生活毫无雅致。若你希冀，\r\n就让我调上一杯供你小憩吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98e4d2271e9cd82e859df646b0f43f271ce38df72a936755fa1cb57e32d80d01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c1285e4e7ba81a10df9520",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新出现的迷惘羔羊群，一看到吾便\r\n落荒而逃……呵，这就是足以毁天\r\n灭地的异能者的感受吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9dbf159ad8266ad853b74213f887325c038641b884d6426b812bbc9fbe50fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383cbe6be16f809d2a94fabd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了抵御暑气，我准备了灵药。\r\n不但口感清凉，用以补充矿物质\r\n也相当合适……你要不要来一点？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db22b1371b67b51db04f2be5f5f8210f5a2dab703a9fdcf3f43df1733cffa4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15ae587a5cad3bd48d4613c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们赛马娘在大地奔跑，因此看见\r\n落叶、落果、落穗后……便会觉得\r\n今年也得感谢大地的恩惠才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca5670d53e069afe1a1d176205012d1f3b1d815bbb2a3fe2104d45398aca463",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9702807a27357891a0b4589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被点缀上深红色的极辣「拉」面……\r\n……呵呵，不愧是殿下的推荐。\r\n一股暖流直窜身体深处，毫不留情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb7a4a62b72fef00aa23cd753060d525b38568524df055d156a9fc9a6d314d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ba428e88791736b77be0fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好感谢圣人的慈爱吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3c07e3e6650532a41ed95218310b157065bde72fe4017d0f8f9eaa745795ee4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe33e03e169b431ff2b365d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……伏特加。与我追寻着相同\r\n美学之人。如果是她，\r\n吾所说的剎那或许能……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1db0a7c9b7c8b89daf1209a29110da211b9a9c07131401ab38df174a1b25ffdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e628fe8170ec05246c836c67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果吉兆自称军神，\r\n吾就该演出光之神啊。\r\n呵呵……就让吾来完美诠释吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60ec365de5c9f50898999057e0fd1bbda1714b624a0bd558c4e75a56c975c72f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac610c5317c7d6dde104cc00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如同生与死是一体两面，\r\n破坏也必定伴随着重生。\r\n这就是我的规则……我的美学。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1dc36ae5fdc7849ad33894e2b1e244de9f4d2733729df22bd1143daf8b8af2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0011347425359fabb774637e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所谓神话，就是集结了过去的\r\n一连串剎那后化为永恒的产物。\r\n因此值得尊敬，且有着流传的价值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "048241910492048f1cdce40fd1376ce027e075ad0949a3cafdd4ad2be31aba04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf574cbf3eb065eb0f13fda5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个雪克杯是父亲送的礼物……\r\n吾认为这代表着调制出琴蕾，\r\n是吾总有一天必须达成的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ae03c3538af91fee5285d9ea1cf3435694a4a17378b4abcc69925cf892b2a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14f06ef8120d8eae90b36b35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台是葡萄酒神的统领之地──\r\n既然如此，吾会发光发热\r\n也是理所当然的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9bc9ec19aa8fa10a8383f445920d95269ecea1419a79c0a92c6ae74200bc422",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc62c67eacf006abe61ef4ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虚构与真实。二律背反。\r\n而正是因为相反，人们才会对舞台\r\n酩酊并为其狂热……我说得没错吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "32d8d9b9f274df895147369cfcae805c8eaeecbcc89cd13d8ec5a19f94d54ade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0901a2c4257fd22c52617aee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黄是天子、蓝是圣母。\r\n吾则是琴蕾──\r\n亦即至高无上的存在！！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e19055298d3ebfdb026b1a96fc0818175b519318eb9675d83828a0da25861a33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df25d88c61ced6ec75166312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了到来之时，我将冲动\r\n深藏于体内。拘束器就是\r\n用以将其压制的装置……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f02d4d78b74bb49f0227897da0cbca4f8bd1016667f9c6c918213bf347dfa751",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3769eca200b0316e0ab88d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要遵循无懈可击的例行项目，\r\n整理仪容再容易不过。\r\n这代的美发王称号就由吾拿下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc57f79e652bb6b267b8276ec5b5a9c608a079cfdb670f64b819c47477c3bebf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c44e6d12012f338fae7f0d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "找到了充满活力的铁栅栏……！\r\n呵呵，哈哈哈！相遇的此刻，\r\n就是该挑战的最佳时机啊──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3ff6a4dc9f585bf926d37dad8e254ed5fa66286f152617c138a903756d04f39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90787519457befdb8f69c59b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的……\r\n「魔性之人」真是棘手。\r\n还是重做一杯吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b8f0f804f879aee72b11a18cf452fad88069b40c15ba8d3673738d35697b3f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673a6a50891e486b5e56b401",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我深爱着充满相遇与离别的\r\n这个季节。因为有欢喜与悲伤。\r\n因为有剎那与永恒之美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9219e22c50cf1ab468da74d2ccbfafa77065a51bbc2d6165e594c61247681d6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:922f134a8dcfdd54fe30275f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在还不到解放这只眼睛的时刻……\r\n可不能屈服于炎热，解开束缚……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97213074f5e1b67e22a3ee87eb3793a5ea44ffea102bfd9cc259a2a07d18f2dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7b5f429867e9348487df967",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿瓦隆的果实很有用……\r\n──不过！那芳醇的香味\r\n对吾来说太甜了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87622b2807fbca756a71780a8c3a12d70080d8a44f70a74b82003d189d4146a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c655d459c7d2c3555f70e8d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪的日子我偏爱读诗体埃达……\r\n众神运用力量与智慧互相争夺的景象，\r\n跟竞赛有共通之处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "719b5e10cba84b5ed7393601dc883f5a999bd20ea0d53c84d98010e1c531d2f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbb28619843a305adbc6698d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "理想的模样已经描绘完毕，\r\n接下来就开始实践吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e8837fa216c406e4aded26ecda511a68ef541d92bd50133b999b57168de8bfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23fee3681c64e51c0bb50b74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b7d69ab49fc0641e5767000f10585546cf0c7394a41814a45559c8645634a6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06021883a1b4a8f0f759246c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多么严苛的困难都要挺身对抗。\r\n就像化作石像，却仍保有自身高洁的\r\n特洛伊祭司一样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b741dc28c2878627dd70d86c16342d3c66b54e3a3337b19850780b119ae818",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b7a2f0e2a2ecc21d374d385",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "惟有锻炼不需要矫饰。\r\n只要专注于实用性。\r\n来吧，你崭露智慧的时刻到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf08c6a51275c9ac89e2e616e065b5024e5efa8db86a3357394553e3c5cb7f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8879aff613d8f0a7a2b3221",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的主观和你的客观，\r\n两者兼具才造就吾的完整。\r\n因此，我想听听你的意见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab635734e7e15b3c290c96d43eee23103889fabf77c4d861f10b993c236ad86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4491b6c9830cd21fae0cb8f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说古代的竞技者们，\r\n都是以初生的赤子模样在战斗。\r\n……呵呵，你想到什么画面了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "16205dd65853d41c1f356944d4c12261a4dac725cfe99237c8b896cf240182ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eedead0f13331623efe5eebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呵，你可别一直发呆。\r\n如果轻易为我沉沦就不好玩了。\r\n你要慢慢、确实、稳健地……酩酊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61b8654f42bd5a9502ebc4ff8454163a0db5ec13483f1bc4966e97d9c1308b0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4f7943805cfdc196366575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等时机到来，再来正式干杯吧。\r\n现在……你就沉醉于我这美酒。\r\n沉醉于这始终至高无上的吾吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3316a7f9586fd453bfe566ad7dc69469709a713dc83fe8d3b2abaaf0754d3acc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:294fe1e6af832a88d84b2ae9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，融化万物的太阳啊！\r\n你打算连这双翅膀都要折断吗！\r\n呵──有意思，尽管剥夺吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9db959b6fdaf7bca3ace56f6eeb530230a1d746cecffdc47524ec95315d5981",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bf24b46872334afb511fffe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈！！这才是极品美酒！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f9f7f16d903d377d5d9e36c1efae9642c2a1ce1f84988afa23eed4f4be72149",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4406e224e956021e900d7845",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起举起庆祝的酒杯吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6e59379dbae0c1aa66145d5663f7ac61462302d441b0032203c71bb4c495f7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:878fe14cfda80b0cd6956548",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获得更强大的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f4dd9242a2670715ce87e6acfd7418e52bdbb7afa6fd3c3fd4c4a574c5085b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbc61184f865ce0188bc78b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是时候踏出伊甸园了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a60b684823401be38c2ad7608bda5ef1a8da71d02d1e12ef1b7c0516542bdd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d57a8ffc8c5b41cefdce668c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我是谷野美酒，为我酩酊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c68ab83980781074d2005c4c2fc963e3a0316c8fffc13ca2a74c6c6a7e78812",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2c53f8da2a60374853e120",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈！将我的、吾的剎那闪光\r\n烙印于眼中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90ef3e051e09bbe40a8452983d8bbfd8651a72a2b3b4b1b94fed8b1f15f1d70c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1866c64aa59f2b35f813943c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你更加甜美的酩酊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "463d44d6926c1632abb65dcf7479e14e1b821d115938366ac19a897b97698379",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8d316c39ab6a019d42723ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极限？刚才已经被我打破了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "539f73ac10fbf9aef8540659ca2dae432aa9627062b6671ccd6f382c59527220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103e5e3f9151c769a281c11a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抬头挺胸，上场吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c1a3a21b9c1b3dd278436bb3ee2e6e0f8ceae566714bbf90920957dd9eb2f71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ceaa516cb915cfab6a8a6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你就是我的训练员。\r\n请你善尽职责，\r\n勤于钻研。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd2327c36f02c14fe99b453c624c71caffb1440bc4b44ce9df89dc3fa64d9dbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1477145eb944ce844c7bc9cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6909154c1e0a5f401735ab17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3023818c4700e403414bdec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请抬头挺胸。\r\n我们仅是对完成职责的你，\r\n做出了评价而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ac19e775cf0462a7ebb89021862c3edd8395fb6ede802308aef50e8b2d1931",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cac46ceab83fe47bee8cb0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必须具备跟家族相称的光芒。\r\n具备那绚烂辉煌──\r\n宛如蝎火般的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa70106c573312a2647b33ea2ec3e6e424c37f78b4c949c0e52a0c174c47ddbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fccfffbee59b08b23ade29e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年时，我们家族会齐聚一堂，\r\n定下该年度的目标。\r\n来接我的时候请绝对不要迟到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b5c38724a8abc5bc19c3345c021e6f2b31be21fc19715e5ad2f1f03fc3ee4c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a45f54b2e68aa45f6933bb56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个……是我的一点心意。\r\n还请笑纳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dbc6a1a8dda0c43db08a40543a1c26a152a53ae84e4284bdb9dda6f7793320d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98341fa0bfed5279a1896cf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请收下这个。\r\n我今年在准备时加入了你的喜好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fd85bd3dfaa23850bdd5e8892612879d1c2e534c88216fbb619985c216d1895",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a79fdddfd49fb2210920a7b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身为天帝之女竟在无意间做出\r\n不该有的举止……对我来说，\r\n这种事已超出了理解范围。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6ba9a01c13f129fee30107faabdcda205e75d9db844d965d5ae525fd3e699c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52675d674e5924fb8b9afb1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我准备了糖果。\r\n……每年的气氛都相当热闹，\r\n因此这是基于礼貌送你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5774c0fd7d2840bee1b045578331f7398bd92f2db8b0351de5455e74b4c2398c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6eb0969034696997b4ac8da6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实，我收到了太阳的邀请函，\r\n约我去布满灯饰的港口城镇散步。\r\n……为什么找我？",
      "source_fingerprint": "959e64b6dede00230b86e7a10143aef9e646d7f33fe2026cc4818a69e95e3413",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c6ce60d002980d90120b6eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你问我相信圣诞老人吗……？\r\n……从哪个观点来说？\r\n我不懂这个问题的意图。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2decedc193d8ff4d9b2a5205874e7962576ebcabf27365aea3204660f9f01fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4dff847d188189f12042f3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是理所当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8268e3074e5a16b79ba4787a8cde185924899d24b88fe9970b7dd1b20cd4d9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33e305d3dd1674fe54c2b4b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使进入新的一年，\r\n也得孜孜不倦……\r\n善尽自己的职责才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "deaa50729c06f3767d47eb3c3472136474ab317361f17fe9bd6b9b642992ea95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9b6853b03fa7247a4d2e210",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\r\n礼物应该会在今天之内\r\n送到训练员室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "168fb6182f2697f24f08b09fa4e7d42ca1e02b4ebe7492bda4fafd5f7ec3dd58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "10011"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
